{"id":"no_tig","lemma":"nötig","pos":"adv","rank":601,"glosses":["urgently"],"ipa":"/ˈnøːtɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/De-n%C3%B6tig.ogg/De-n%C3%B6tig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist all das nötig?","en":"Is all this necessary?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756467","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Warum sollte das nötig sein?","en":"Why should that be necessary?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Denkst du, daß das nötig war?","en":"Did you think that was necessary?","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich habe deine Hilfe nötig.","en":"I need your help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393860","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"the act of helping"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben Geld nötig.","en":"We need money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50611","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"money"},null]}]}